<div class="modal fade" id="rollbackEndLeaseModal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <form method="post" action="{% url 'leases:lease_end_rollback_action' lease.pk %}">
        {% csrf_token %}
        <div class="modal-header py-2">
          <h5 class="modal-title">Roll Back Lease End</h5>
          <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
        </div>
        <div class="modal-body">
          <div class="alert alert-warning py-2 small">
            This reactivates the lease, cancels the final-settlement invoice and pending refund,
            restores invoices cancelled by End Lease, and reverses any security applied to the lease balance.
            Messages already sent cannot be recalled. After a successful rollback, the End Lease window
            opens automatically so you can enter the corrected end date and settlement.
          </div>
          <label class="form-label small fw-semibold">Restore Contract End Date</label>
          <input type="date" name="restored_end_date" class="form-control form-control-sm"
                 value="{{ rollback_default_end_date|date:'Y-m-d' }}" required>
          <label class="form-label small fw-semibold mt-2">Rollback Notes</label>
